    21	   `docs/revision/churn/churn_pod.sh`): stages stop only between stages at the soft cap; the one exception is the
    22	   watchdog, which deletes the pod at 1.3 times the cap at the price ceiling; attempts persist in its attempts file, with
    23	   the bound at the ceiling; it passes the allocation time, the price and the earlier attempts' charges to the driver.
