    34	4. A pod-side memory preflight before the nine-worker stages: the cgroup limit, one full evaluate task's peak (four
    35	   profiles) in a child process, the parent's own memory, and fewer workers if needed (section 7).
    36	5. The creation-time newest statistic is labelled as such, and the mechanism-relevant one is added: first-offer age among
    37	   the identities holding assigned jobs (section 4).
