   117	  commit; runner and `sim/` equal protocol-v2; each job's runner, salt, configuration, root, seeds, rule parameters and
   118	  context equal its frozen reference's provenance; output not inside `--src` or `eval/all`. Inputs are copied read-only
   119	  and hash-checked against the original records and freeze; the follow-up freeze and acceptance run before evaluation
   120	  and doubling; a final inventory records every output hash, the environment, and the churn driver's hash.
   121	- **Validation before spend (free, on the Mac).** (a) Unit tests: the churn policy is truthful and exits at rate p,
   122	  deterministically; p = 0 never exits; the wrapper adds churning opponents to training and evaluation cells, also in
   123	  pool workers, and leaves other jobs unchanged; churn ids and provenance are distinct; under churn every menu candidate
   124	  is rerun on the five training seeds and the frozen reference's score is recomputed; newcomer counts, unavailable
   125	  bins, the focal newest share, market pooling; the gate's id mapping; a failed gate stops dispatch; the cap check. (b)
   126	  A smoke-size run of the whole path for fresh0 R3 at p = 0.05, including the gate path, both winners' diagnostics, and
   127	  the memory preflight on its output; production refuses a missing `--started`, `--gate skip`, and a separate stage
   128	  without a saved passing gate; the worker limit fits the memory limit. All pass: `uv run pytest -q docs/revision/churn`
   129	  (32 passed: also the bit-identity pod gate, the preflight's real-task sample, admission after the preflight with
   130	  the kept worker limit, a skipped record never counted as a measurement, a retry reusing only an applicable saved
   131	  measurement, and the worker limit kept across separate-stage commands, the diagnostics included; round 5: rule coverage
   132	  of a reused measurement, rejection of older records, and dispatch of measured jobs).
   133	- **(c) The p = 0 gate, first on the pod.** The driver runs fresh0 R3 D2+H3 at p = 0 through the injected path (inputs,
   134	  search, freeze, acceptance, evaluation, doubling) into `gate-p0/`, maps the id `|churn0` to the registered id, and
